@startuml 개인성격분석_시퀀스

autonumber

actor User as U
participant FlutterApp as F
participant "SajuController\n(Flask API)" as C
participant "SajuCalculator" as SC
participant "PersonalityAnalyzer" as PA

U -> F: 개인 성격 분석 버튼 클릭
F -> C: POST /api/v1/saju/analyze-personality\n{ saju, gender }
C -> SC: analyze_personality(saju, gender)
SC -> PA: analyze_five_elements(saju)
PA --> SC: five
SC -> PA: calculate_8_traits(saju)
PA --> SC: traits
SC -> SC: calculate_personality_flags_hd2(saju, gender)
note over SC
내부 단계:
 - _build_tokens_from_saju
 - _predict_sky / _predict_earth
 - _original_calculate(자기-자기)
 - sal0 -> flags 추출
end note
SC -> PA: generate_personality_report(traits)
PA --> SC: report
SC --> C: { five, traits, flags, report }
C --> F: 200 OK JSON
F --> U: 결과 화면 표시

@enduml


